<view class="page registration-page"><view class="title">本人就诊信息</view><view class="subtitle">首次填写后即可预约，无需提前获取患者编号。</view>
 <view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="loading">正在办理，请稍候…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button wx:if="{{!clinics.length}}" class="link" bindtap="login">前往微信登录</button></view><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="notice">{{notice}}</view>
 <view wx:if="{{binding}}" class="card"><view class="row"><view class="card-title">本人就诊资料已关联</view><text class="badge">可预约</text></view><view class="description">当前微信账号可使用对应的本人就诊服务。</view><view class="spacer"></view><button type="primary" bindtap="booking">立即预约</button><button class="link" bindtap="profile">查看本人就诊资料 ›</button><view class="footnote">新登记资料为本人填报，医护将在就诊时复核。已有档案换号或解绑，请联系门店。</view></view>
 <block wx:if="{{!binding && clinics.length}}"><view class="registration-tabs"><button class="{{mode === 'new' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-mode="new" bindtap="selectMode" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}">首次就诊</button><button class="{{mode === 'existing' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-mode="existing" bindtap="selectMode" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}">关联已有档案</button></view>
 <view wx:if="{{mode === 'new'}}" class="card"><view class="card-title">填写本人资料</view><view class="description">系统会自动生成患者编号。请勿代填他人资料；已在本机构就诊过，请选择关联已有档案。</view>
 <view class="field"><text class="field-label">就诊门店</text><picker range="{{clinics}}" range-key="label" value="{{clinicIndex}}" bindchange="selectClinic" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}"><view class="picker">{{clinics[clinicIndex].label || '请选择门店'}}<text class="picker-arrow">⌄</text></view></picker></view>
 <view class="field"><text class="field-label">本人姓名</text><input class="input" value="{{details.full_name}}" data-field="full_name" bindinput="inputDetails" placeholder="请填写真实姓名" maxlength="100" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}"/></view>
 <view class="field"><text class="field-label">出生日期</text><picker mode="date" end="{{today}}" value="{{details.date_of_birth}}" bindchange="inputRegistrationBirth" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}"><view class="picker">{{details.date_of_birth || '请选择本人出生日期'}}<text class="picker-arrow">⌄</text></view></picker></view>
 <view class="field"><text class="field-label">联系电话</text><input class="input" type="number" value="{{details.phone}}" data-field="phone" bindinput="inputDetails" placeholder="用于门店联系与就诊通知" maxlength="30" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}"/></view>
 <view class="hint">仅填写预约所需信息。地址、邮箱和紧急联系人可在后续就诊时补充。</view>
 <view class="divider"></view><view class="field-label">本人过敏情况</view><radio-group bindchange="changeAllergy"><label class="allergy-option"><radio value="NONE" color="#17778b" checked="{{allergyStatement === 'NONE'}}" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}"/>无已知过敏</label><label class="allergy-option"><radio value="KNOWN" color="#17778b" checked="{{allergyStatement === 'KNOWN'}}" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}"/>有过敏史</label><label class="allergy-option"><radio value="UNSURE" color="#17778b" checked="{{allergyStatement === 'UNSURE'}}" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}"/>不确定</label></radio-group><view wx:if="{{allergyStatement === 'KNOWN' || allergyStatement === 'UNSURE'}}" class="field"><textarea class="input allergy-note" value="{{allergyNote}}" bindinput="inputAllergy" placeholder="请描述已知药物、食物等过敏情况；不确定可选填" maxlength="500" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}"/></view><view class="hint">以上为本人填报，不代表医护已核实；不会因此阻止首次预约，就诊时请主动向医生说明。</view>
 <view class="spacer"></view><checkbox-group bindchange="confirmRegistration"><label class="check-label"><checkbox value="confirmed" checked="{{consent}}" color="#17778b" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}"/><text>确认填写的是本人资料且内容属实，同意将这些信息用于预约、就诊及门店联系。</text></label></checkbox-group><view class="spacer"></view><button type="primary" bindtap="register" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">{{unknown ? '重新确认登记结果' : '保存资料，继续预约'}}</button></view>
 <block wx:else><view class="card soft"><view class="card-title">保护您原有的就诊信息</view><view class="description">此入口用于关联已有病历和预约；为防止误关联他人档案，需要门店核实。首次就诊请选择上方“首次就诊”，无需患者编号或人工核验。</view></view><view wx:if="{{submitted}}" class="card"><view class="row"><view class="card-title">申请已提交</view><text class="badge warn">待门店核实</text></view><view class="description">无需重复提交。请联系门店核实原档案，换微信账号时由门店办理换号。</view></view><view wx:else class="card"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">原患者编号</text><input class="input" placeholder="诊所提供的已有患者编号" value="{{number}}" bindinput="inputNumber" maxlength="30" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}"/><view class="hint">不知道编号，请联系原就诊门店查询。</view></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">出生日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{birth}}" bindchange="inputBirth" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}"><view class="picker">{{birth || '选择本人出生日期'}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">服务门店</text><picker range="{{clinics}}" range-key="label" value="{{clinicIndex}}" bindchange="selectClinic" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}"><view class="picker">{{clinics[clinicIndex].label || '选择门店'}}</view></picker></view><view class="spacer"></view><button type="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">{{unknown ? '重新确认申请结果' : '申请关联已有档案'}}</button><button wx:if="{{unknown}}" class="link" bindtap="query" disabled="{{busy}}">查询原申请结果</button></view></block></block>
 <button class="secondary" bindtap="load" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新就诊资料状态</button><view class="footnote">微信登录与就诊资料分别保存。小程序仅提供当前账号对应的本人服务。</view>
</view>